# agents.registry — legacy Skill target overrides
#
# Preset agents live in agents.catalog.json. Entries here override a preset path
# with the same name or add a custom command with a skill directory. The web UI does not add
# entries to this file. Use agents.local.json for new definitions and complete resource rules.
#
# Format:  <name> | <skill dir>      (dir may use ~, expanded at runtime)
# Edit this file directly when a Skill target needs a local override. Preset configuration roots remain independent.
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.

# Official configuration environment variables remain independent of Skill target overrides.
# Example: claude | /absolute/path/to/claude/skills
